# Mines and the horn (spec M4c): pause.scenario's way into the race with the test game armed
# with three mines (--save 0:FILE with the player's mines at 3), then from the race's 431st
# frame a mine dropped standing (left Alt), a second press inside the 50 ticks' wait, the car
# backed over its own mine (Down) through the blast, another mine, and the horn (space) held
# with the accelerator. A shot every 100 ms; run with --no-ai --watch.
